class: runtime
summary: D471 and D491 under hosted/events a task on a module-storage stack that has waited once in the provider's loop recurses past its stack and traps stack_exhausted in the prologue of the routine whose frame would not fit, at that routine's site
program: main.ldn
root: ../../../../..
profiles: specialization
traps: yes
trap_report: main.ldn:23:1: trap: stack_exhausted
constructs: 1380, 1620, 1670, 1675, 1910, 1995
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, linux-rv64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64
